    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Butuku abu mukelenge kakamanya mua kulala tulu; wakamba dî diandi, bakalua ne mukanda wa kulondolola kua malu, bakaubala ku mesu kua mukelenge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakasangana bualu bufundamu ne, Môdekai wakamba bua Bigetana ne Telesha, babidi ba bantu batungula ba mukelenge ba munkatshi mua balami ba tshibi bakadi bakeba bua kushiha mukelenge Ahashawelosha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakabebesha ne, Kutumbisha kai kuakatumbishabo nʼaku Môdekai bua bualu ebu? Hashishe bena mudimu ba mukelenge bakadi bamukuatshila mudimu bakamuambila ne, Kabena bamuenzele tshintu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wakakonka ne, Udi mu tshiendedi nganyi? Ha diba adi Hamana wakabuela mu tshiendedi tshia mu nsubu wa mukelenge bua kumuebesha bualu bua kuoweye Môdekai ku tshiowelu tshiamulongolueleye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bena mudimu ba mukelenge bakamuambila ne, Hamana udi muimane mu tshiendedi. Mukelenge wakamba ne, Abuele biandi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Hamana wakabuela. Mukelenge wakamuebesha ne, Nebenzele muntu udi mukelenge musue kunemeka tshinyi? Nunku Hamana wakadi wamba mu mutshima wandi ne, Nganyi udi mukelenge usanka bua kunemeka muntambe meme? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Hamana wakambila mukelenge ne, Bua muntu udi mukelenge usanka kunemeka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "balue ne bilulu bidi mukelenge uluata ne kabalu kadi mukelenge wenda ha nyima haku ne tshifulu tshia bukelenge tshidiye wasa ku mutu kuandi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bafile bintu ebi ne kabalu mu bianza bia umue wa bantu ba mukelenge badi batamba buneme, baluatshishe muntu udi mukelenge usanka bua kunemeka, bendeshe muntu au ha nyima ha kabalu aka mu musesu wa musoko, bele dî ku mpala kuandi ne, Nebenzele muntu udi mukelenge usanka bua kunemeka nunku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe mukelenge wakambila Hamana ne, Ya lubilu, wangate bilulu ne kabalu, bu muwakuamba, wenzele Môdekai, Muena Yuda, udi mushikame ku tshibi tshia mukelenge nunku; kuhangi nansha dî dimue dia mu mei onso awakuamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Hamana wakangata bilulu ne kabalu, wakabiluatshisha Môdekai, wakamuendesha ha nyima ha kabalu mu musesu wa musoko, wakela dî ku mpala kuandi ne. Nebenzele muntu udi mukelenge usanka bua kunemeka nunku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Môdekai wakahingana ku tshibi tshia mukelenge. Kadi Hamana wakaya ku nsubu wandi lubilu, udila muadi ne mutu wandi mubuikila tshilulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hamana wakambila mukashi wandi Zeleshe ne balunda bandi bualu buonso buakamukuata. Hashishe bena meji bandi ne mukashi wandi Zeleshe bakamuambila ne, Bikala Môdekai, uwakabanga kulekela ku mesu kuandi, wa bana ba Bena Yuda, wewe kuena mumanye mua kumuhita bukole; kadi wewe neuhone ku mpala kuandi bulelela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EST 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakadibo bayikila nʼandi, muntu mutungula wa mukelenge wakalua bua kubikileye Hamana ku bidia bia disanka dinene biakalongolola Esetê.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EST.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EST.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
